# A chat on a computer (MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800): its composer with the cursor in it as the chat
# comes, words written in it (sfpages' composer_node with MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=composed, the old view's with
# MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=nodes).
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
type 帮我看一下登录按钮
wait 900
exit
